[00:01.75]Honesty - 张韶涵
[00:07.13]Why “Honesty” is such a lonely word 
[00:16.77]People can’t be honest
[00:21.26]Because they used to be dishonest 
[00:27.28]Or because protecting someone you love
[00:33.32]So you can’t be honest 
[00:38.61]Or because you have difficulties
[00:45.80]So you can’t be honest 
[01:08.09]If you search for tenderness
[01:11.57]It isn't hard to find
[01:14.91]You can have the love you need to live
[01:21.85]But if you look for truthfulness
[01:24.71]You might just as well be blind
[01:28.46]It always seems to be so hard to give
[01:35.51]Honesty is such a lonely word
[01:42.34]Everyone is so untrue
[01:49.28]Honesty is hardly ever heard
[01:55.95]And mostly what I need from you
[02:03.48]I can always find someone
[02:06.91]To say they sympathize
[02:10.48]If I wear my heart out on my sleeve
[02:17.43]But I don't want some pretty face
[02:20.41]To tell me pretty lies
[02:23.88]All I want is someone to believe
[02:31.15]Honesty is such a lonely word
[02:38.15]Everyone is so untrue
[02:44.80]Honesty is hardly ever heard
[02:51.66]And mostly what I need from you
[03:02.90]I can find a lover
[03:06.09]I can find a friend
[03:09.46]I can have security
[03:12.46]Until the bitter end
[03:16.40]Anyone can comfort me
[03:19.37]With promises again
[03:22.49]I know  I know
[03:34.18]When I'm deep inside of me
[03:37.68]Don't be too concerned
[03:40.86]I won't ask for nothin' while I'm gone
[03:47.53]But when I want sincerity
[03:50.57]Tell me where else can I turn
[03:54.22]'Cause you're the one that I depend upon
[04:01.50]Honesty is such a lonely word
